# 统一换行符处理，避免 Windows/Linux 之间来回转换产生的噪音

# 默认：Git 仓库内统一存 LF，检出到工作区时按平台自动转换
* text=auto

# 明确按文本处理（仓库内 LF）
*.java      text
*.xml       text
*.yml       text
*.yaml      text
*.properties text
*.sql       text
*.md        text
*.json      text
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.txt       text

# Windows 专用脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.jar       binary
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.gif       binary
*.ico       binary
*.pdf       binary
*.zip       binary
*.xlsx      binary
